sequenceDiagram
    participant STM32 as STM32 FreeRTOS
    participant EXTI as DATA_READY Pin
    participant SPI as SPI Bus (MISO/CS/CLK)
    participant PI_IRQ as Pi Hard IRQ
    participant PI_WQ as Pi Workqueue (SPI Driver)

    loop Every 10ms (100Hz)
        STM32->>STM32: Format Frame (Keep UART active)
        STM32->>SPI: Load SPI TX Register
        STM32->>EXTI: Drive HIGH
        EXTI->>PI_IRQ: Rising Edge Detected
        PI_IRQ->>PI_WQ: Schedule Bottom Half
        PI_IRQ->>EXTI: Return (Fast Exit)

        Note over PI_WQ, SPI: Workqueue executes asynchronously
        PI_WQ->>SPI: Drive CS LOW (Start)
        PI_WQ->>SPI: Generate Clock Pulses
        SPI-->>PI_WQ: Shift out Telemetry Frame
        PI_WQ->>SPI: Drive CS HIGH (End)

        PI_WQ->>EXTI: Acknowledge (STM32 drives LOW)
    end
